// SSOAttributeMapping names the ID-token claims that carry the user's email,
// name and groups. An empty email or name means the standard claim (email,
// name). groups names the claim or attribute that carries the user's groups,
// which sign-in matches against the connection's group mappings. An Entra
// token lists only the groups assigned to the application; a user in too many
// groups gets an overage pointer instead, which changes nothing, and is refused
// when deny_unmapped is on.
